      "parent_id": "section-ebed6f3dd99afc98121b",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "K8S集群软件故障排查 / 插件维护管理 / Kubernetes\nd.使用本地镜像安装集群或插件，后续操作与在线安装步骤相同\nsealos run docker.io/labring/kubernetes:v1.25.6 --single",
      "block_ids": [
        "manual-1edf23113651430f:b003084",
        "manual-1edf23113651430f:b003085"
      ],
      "locators": [
        "word/document.xml/body/p[1893]",
        "word/document.xml/body/p[1894]"
